ric: │ └──────────────────┘ └──────────────────┘ │\n      - generic: │ │\n      - generic: │ ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │\n      - generic: │ │ Coordinator(Redis / etcd / InMemory) │ │\n      - generic: │ │ 跨进程 leader 选举 · HA lease │ │\n      - generic: │ └────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │\n      - generic: └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n      - generic: 🚫 不是字面\"3 颗心脏\"\n      - generic: ✅ 就是一个 Scheduler + CircuitBreakerGroup + HA Coordinator\n    - separator\n    - heading \"第五张图 · 前端入口到后端的全链路\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: 完整请求生命周期（合并前面所有图的主线）：\n    - button \"Download file\":\n    - button:\n    - code:\n      - generic: \"[React app]\"\n      - generic: \"│ POST /api/threads/{id}/runs/stream (context.mode = \\\"chat\\\" | \\\"react\\\" | \\\"deep\\\")\"\n      - generic: ▼\n      - generic: 🪸 Siphon\n      - generic: │ ParsedIntent + user_context (profile_memories 等)\n      - generic: ▼\n      - generic: 🐚 SpinalCord ─── 命中 ──► 直接返回 (0 LLM)\n      - generic: │ 未命中\n      - generic: ▼\n      - generic: \"[mode 分发]\"\n      - generic: ├── \"chat\"(默认) ──► 🧠 Cerebrum ──► DAG ──► 🧬 Ganglia ──► 🦑 Arms ──► 🐦 Beak ... ──► Final 回复\n      - generic: │ ↓\n      - generic: │ 每 step 写 📘 Journal\n      - generic: │ ↓\n      - generic: │ 触发 ⟳ Regeneration\n      - generic: │ ↓\n      - generic: │ 更新 Cerebrum.learned_rules\n      - generic: │\n      - generic: ├── \"react\" ──► stream_react_loop(每步 LLM + 🐦 Beak + 🎭 Camouflage variant)\n      - generic: │ ↓\n      - generic: │ 流式 yield tool_start / tool_end (SSE custom 事件)\n      - generic: │ ↓\n      - generic: │ _persist_react_trajectory → 📘 Journal + ⟳ Regeneration\n      - generic: │\n      - generic: └── \"deep\" ──► 🧠 Cerebrum(deliberative + Opus) ──► 多 🦑 Arm 协作 ──► Final\n    - separator\n    - heading \"数据持久化矩阵\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: 所有状态如何落盘：\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n     